{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>בִבְכִי.</b> In place of a pause. And like it: ראה עֳנִי (Lamentations 3:1)."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 45, :notes {0 "Reading הפסקא as referring to a pausal construction; the point is that the maqqef-like joining of ב to בכי occurs where a pause would otherwise be expected."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:48:01.014383559Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}